.TH GROUP-AUDIT 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "Unix Administration"
.SH NAME
group-audit \- Check the structure of a local Unix group file
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgroup-audit\fR [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Does not modify files. Duplicate group IDs and names are warnings. Malformed records or member names are errors. NIS compatibility entries are skipped.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file PATH
Read the specified group file instead of /etc/group.
.TP
.B --help
Display usage information.
.TP
.B --version
Display program version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 completed, 1 malformed local data or traversal errors, 2 argument errors, 3 missing prerequisites.
.SH SEE ALSO
passwd(5), group(5), getent(1)
.SH AUTHOR
SASD Freeware contributors.
